How many records are there of the threat actor browsing the Azure Crest Hospital's website?
This one is a bit more complicated:
let ips =
InboundNetworkEvents
| where url has_all ("azure", "search")
| distinct src_ip;
InboundNetworkEvents
| where src_ip in (ips)
This makes a variable called ips, and in that variable, we put the  distinct source IPs from InboundNetworkEvents where the IP "search"ed the "azure"crest site. Then, we take those IPs, and just filter on those in the InboundNetworkEvents in general.
This only gives 31, though, and the answer is 32. I'm assuming the last one is because they went to the site itself first.

